us, were also carrying and holding so much heavy equipment all day.

942
00:40:04.980 --> 00:40:05.420
Yeah.

943
00:40:05.740 --> 00:40:09.300
And Ken was like, you know, Ange, it was record-breaking heat wave.

944
00:40:09.400 --> 00:40:10.840
And I was like, oh, no, it was triple digits.

945
00:40:10.960 --> 00:40:11.800
We talked about that.

946
00:40:11.980 --> 00:40:16.580
But as we were talking, Jenna, I remembered this thing that I did not remember the first

947
00:40:16.580 --> 00:40:16.900
time.

948
00:40:17.240 --> 00:40:20.620
And when I rewatched it, I couldn't believe we didn't comment on it.

949
00:40:20.860 --> 00:40:27.700
You know, if you watch Dwight in any of his scenes, you see a full white T-shirt hanging

950
00:40:27.700 --> 00:40:29.860
out from his short sleeve button down.

951
00:40:29.860 --> 00:40:32.180
You see his white T-shirt sleeve.

952
00:40:32.560 --> 00:40:37.520
And it was because he was sweating so much that he had to wear that shirt because he

953
00:40:37.520 --> 00:40:39.740
