954
00:40:40.100 --> 00:40:40.540
Yeah.

955
00:40:40.760 --> 00:40:44.200
So they were layering the guys so they wouldn't sweat through their shirts.

956
00:40:44.700 --> 00:40:45.660
So crazy.

957
00:40:46.240 --> 00:40:51.140
Well, Ange, when I was trading messages with Kent, he also mentioned the heat.

958
00:40:51.140 --> 00:40:57.700
He said this, quote, because we filmed this episode the first week of a hot August and

959
00:40:57.700 --> 00:41:03.220
a lot of our filming was outside in the parking lot, I made the decision to silk the exterior

960
00:41:03.220 --> 00:41:08.000
parking lot from the rooftop to the sidewalk so we could keep a little cooler.

961
00:41:08.340 --> 00:41:09.300
Remember those?

962
00:41:09.660 --> 00:41:09.780
Yeah.

963
00:41:10.200 --> 00:41:12.020
Wasn't it just like a giant tarp?

964
00:41:12.160 --> 00:41:19.240
It's like a very thin, white, silky, scrim tarp thing.

965
00:41:19.240 --> 00:41:19.780
Yeah.

966
00:41:19.980 --> 00:41:20.140
Yeah.

967
00:41:20.260 --> 00:41:23.320
And it's meant to kind of just diffuse the sunlight.

968
00:41:23.320 --> 00:41:30.260
So it's not, I don't think it's SPF or anything, but it does like cut the heat.

969
00:41:30.440 --> 00:41:36.880
It's almost like in your house if you drew like a sheer curtain to cut the sun.

970
00:41:37.120 --> 00:41:43.620
Well, Kent said, quote, I kind of regretted that decision because you can see those silks

971
00:41:43.620 --> 00:41:48.080
in some of the shots and they were noisy as they flapped in the breeze.

972
00:41:48.960 --> 00:41:54.120
Now, I did not notice them when I was re-watching this episode, but I think it's funny that

973
00:41:54.120 --> 00:41:57.540
after all these years, he is still annoyed.

974
00:41:57.780 --> 00:41:58.920
He still remembers.

975
00:41:59.060 --> 00:42:01.120
He's like, oh, those silks, those silks.

976
00:42:02.360 --> 00:42:09.860
I also thought this is when I think the fact that both Randall Einhorn and Matt Sohn had

977
00:42:09.860 --> 00:42:12.800
been camera operators on Survivor.

978
00:42:12.880 --> 00:42:14.800
I feel like that really paid off.

979
00:42:15.160 --> 00:42:22.740
Really came in handy because I know they did some pretty grueling things, you know, in those

980
00:42:22.740 --> 00:42:26.700
seasons of Survivor when people are like hiking through wilderness.

981
00:42:26.700 --> 00:42:32.440
Yeah, there's, you know, Randall and Matt were hiking alongside of them filming it all.

982
00:42:32.700 --> 00:42:37.020
